  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add ginger paste and jasmine rice, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the boiling water (5 cups for 2 people / 10 cups for 4 people) and chicken stock pot. Cover with a lid and simmer over medium heat, stirring occasionally, until rice is tender, 20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-f3b6ed00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice red radish into sticks.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-56106e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once rice is tender, remove lid and stir in sweetcorn and the salt.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, uncovered, until congee has thickened, 15-20 minutes. Season to taste. TIP: Add an extra dash of water to your congee if you prefer a thinner consistency.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-cc6e1c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While congee is thickening, in a small heatproof bowl, combine garlic, the brown sugar and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• In a large frying pan, heat olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) over high heat, until just smoking, 30 seconds-1 minute, then carefully pour the oil over the garlic mixture.\n• Stir in soy sauce mix until combined. Set aside. TIP: The hot oil will bubble up and ‘cook’ the garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-8db14d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When congee has 5 minutes remaining, return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Asian BBQ seasoning, Asian greens and a splash of water and cook until fragrant and wilted, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-9ac1a840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide ginger congee between bowls. Top with Chinese BBQ plant-based mince and radish.\n• Drizzle garlic chilli oil over congee.\n• Sprinkle over crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0708f5ad8e6534c44388/step-a21bc850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
